[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:After the Fire]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.30]What was the danger to the villages after the fire? | 大火之后村庄面临什么危险？
[00:16.43]Firemen had been fighting the forest fire for nearly three weeks before they could get it under control. | 消防员们与那场森林大火搏斗了将近3个星期才把它控制住。
[00:24.71]A short time before, great trees had covered the countryside for miles around. | 就在不久之前，方圆数英里之内曾覆盖着大片森林。
[00:32.82]Now, smoke still rose up from the warm ground over the desolate hills. | 现在，荒芜的山丘上，温暖的地面仍在冒着烟。
[00:40.73]Winter was coming on and the hills threatened the surrounding villages with destruction, | 冬季即将来临，这些山丘对周围的村庄构成了毁灭性的威胁，
[00:48.68]for heavy rain would not only wash away the soil but would cause serious floods as well. | 因为大雨不仅会冲走土壤，还会引起严重的水灾。
[00:56.96]When the fire had at last been put out, | 大火终于被扑灭之后，
[01:00.53]the forest authorities ordered several tons of a special type of grass-seed which would grow quickly. | 林业部门订购了好几吨一种生长迅速的特殊草籽。
[01:08.80]The seed was sprayed over the ground in huge quantities by aeroplanes. | 飞机把这些草籽大量地撒播在地面上。
[01:15.84]The planes had been planting seed for nearly a month when it began to rain. | 播撒草籽将近一个月之后，天下起了雨。
[01:21.84]By then, however, in many places the grass had already taken root. | 然而到那时为止，很多地方的草已经生根了。
[01:28.38]In place of the great trees which had been growing there for centuries, | 在生长了几个世纪的参天大树的地方，
[01:33.66]patches of green had begun to appear in the blackened soil. | 一片片绿色开始在发黑的土壤上出现。
